// ICF codes, Socialstyrelsen inventory to SNOMED CT mappings, codes s8
// Several sources map to the same target; each mapping is its own assertion.
context {
    collection "icf-snomed-ct" version="2026.1"
    source system="ICF" release="2026"
    target system="SNOMED_CT" release="20251130"
}
defaults {
    mappings {
        preference "primary"
        assessment-method "source-default-granularity"
    }
}
mapping "s8.1" source="s8" target="SNOMED_CT:39937001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s8 = ICF Chapter 8 SNOMED CT 39937001 (skin, glands, nails, hair). SNOMED CT has no single
        aggregate that also folds in nails/hair; closest standard concept is SCTID 39937001 (OMOP
        4219601), which covers the skin axis but is broader than the chapter that additionally includes
        nails/hair/glands. broader (skin structure subsumes the skin portion of the chapter), high : a
        verified SNOMED CT body-structure concept and the legitimate ancestor of the chapter's skin
        members, though it does not subsume the nail/hair/gland members. Used as the chapter anchor;
        component-specific siblings (s820/s830/s840) get their own exact equivalents.
        """
}
mapping "s810.1" source="s810" target="SNOMED_CT:39937001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s810 SNOMED CT 39937001 = ICF mid-level, the generic regional-skin grouping whose children
        are s8100-s8105 (skin of head/neck, shoulder, upper limb, pelvis, lower limb, trunk). SNOMED CT
        models regional skin as a flat sibling set (etc.) with no single aggregate parent above them
        other than itself. SCTID 39937001 (OMOP 4219601) fully contains the regional-skin scope.
        broader, high : one-level climb from the generic regional grouping to its verified SNOMED CT
        ancestor.
        """
}
mapping "s8100.1" source="s8100" target="SNOMED_CT:58308009" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s8100 SNOMED CT 58308009 = skin of head and neck. Target 58308009 (OMOP 4237609) denotes the
        same anatomical region at the same specificity. Exact 1:1 body-structure equivalence,
        confidence.
        """
}
