    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s8103 SNOMED CT 281730006 = skin of pelvic region. SNOMED CT's nearest standard concept is
        SCTID 281730006 (OMOP 4083649); is slightly narrower than the ICF full pelvic region. The target
        is the closest available; treated as broader (the regional concept legitimately covers the
        pelvic skin scope) at high rather than exact because of the qualifier. SE mirror not consulted;
        Athena body-structure hierarchy confirms the anchor.
        """
}
