mapping "s8404.1" source="s8404" target="SNOMED_CT:256423008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s8404 SNOMED CT 256423008 = ICF s840 subdivision: body hair (hair over the body generally,
        as distinct from scalp s8401, facial, axillary s8402 and pubic s8403 hair which have their own
        codes). Target (Athena 4107478) =, active standard, Swedish synonym. No dedicated body-structure
        concept exists in SNOMED CT; 256423008 is the co-extensive general-regional hair concept (hair on a
        skin region = body hair). High tier : strong concept and Swedish-synonym equivalence, but no
        independent Athena crosswalk re-verified and is marginally more generic than, so rather than.
        """
}
mapping "s8408.1" source="s8408" target="SNOMED_CT:386045008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s8408 SNOMED CT 386045008 = ICF residual under s840 Structures of hair: denotes some
        specified-but-uncoded part of the hair. Target (Athena 4300948) =, active standard, Swedish
        synonym (note: older sctid 58240005 is inactive/D, 386045008 is the active concept). The parent
        hair-structure concept fully subsumes any hair part, so the target is broader. High tier : clean
        one-level broader map of a residual to its verified parent body-structure concept. Mirrors the
        s2608 precedent.
        """
}
